https://www.azinat.com/2019/07/rencontre-du-parc-pyreneen-des-trois-nations-une-plaque-posee-en-memoire-de-michel-sebastien/', '{"en":"This long and engaging high-mountain route starts from Arinsal, following well-marked trails with yellow circles and signposts up to Pic de Medacorba. The ascent to Medacorba involves some steep sections and minor scrambling, but without major technical difficulties.\n\nThe subsequent ascent to Roca Entravessada is more challenging, traversing a very steep slope with sparse cairns and faint path traces. It requires careful route-finding to intuit the best line, skirting the base of two gendarmes and choosing the correct gully to avoid the full crest. This 15.7 km route with 1577 m of elevation gain is considered difficult due to its length and elevation.","ca":"Aquesta llarga i entretinguda ruta d''alta muntanya comença a Arinsal, seguint senders ben marcats amb cercles grocs i pals indicadors fins al Pic de Medacorba. L''ascens a Medacorba implica algunes seccions costerudes i petites grimpades, però sense grans dificultats tècniques.\n\nL''ascens posterior a la Roca Entravessada és més desafiant, travessant un vessant molt escarpat amb fites disperses i traces de camí poc clares. Requereix una navegació acurada per intuir la millor línia, vorejant la base de dos gendarmes i escollint la canal correcta per evitar la cresta completa. Aquesta ruta de 15,7 km amb 1577 m de desnivell positiu es considera difícil per la seva longitud i desnivell.","es":"Esta larga y entretenida ruta de alta montaña comienza en Arinsal, siguiendo senderos bien marcados con círculos amarillos y postes indicadores hasta el Pic de Medacorba. El ascenso a Medacorba implica algunas secciones empinadas y pequeñas trepadas, pero sin grandes dificultades técnicas.\n\nEl ascenso posterior a la Roca Entravessada es más desafiante, atravesando una ladera muy escarpada con hitos dispersos y débiles trazas de camino. Requiere una navegación cuidadosa para intuir la mejor línea, bordeando la base de dos gendarmes y eligiendo la canal correcta para evitar la cresta completa. Esta ruta de 15,7 km con 1577 m de desnivel positivo se considera difícil por su longitud y desnivel."}'::jsonb, 'revillacarlos', 15691, 1577, 1577, 2956, 1575, 'difficult', 'loop', 26460, 38640, 2806, '2025-09-13', '2025-08', '[{"lat":42.579574,"lng":1.478147,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579495,"lng":1.477917,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579586,"lng":1.478115,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579719,"lng":1.478444,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579536,"lng":1.478329,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579519,"lng":1.478391,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579505,"lng":1.478454,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579533,"lng":1.478532,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579555,"lng":1.478593,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579575,"lng":1.478668,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579589,"lng":1.478726,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579605,"lng":1.478789,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579618,"lng":1.478856,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579625,"lng":1.47892,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579671,"lng":1.478896,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579686,"lng":1.478834,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579704,"lng":1.478777,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.57973,"lng":1.478724,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.57977,"lng":1.478672,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579814,"lng":1.478632,"ele":1574.8},{"lat":42.579862,"lng":1.478614,"ele":1575},{"lat":42.579918,"lng":1.478624,"ele":1575.1},{"lat":42.57997,"lng":1.478653,"ele":1575.5},{"lat":42.580013,"lng":1.478692,"ele":1575.9},{"lat":42.580045,"lng":1.478751,"ele":1576.1},{"lat":42.580065,"lng":1.478806,"ele":1576.4},{"lat":42.580073,"lng":1.478869,"ele":1576.7},{"lat":42.580089,"lng":1.478927,"ele":1576.8},{"lat":42.580108,"lng":1.478997,"ele":1577},{"lat":42.580102,"lng":1.479062,"ele":1577.7},{"lat":42.580098,"lng":1.47913,"ele":1579.4},{"lat":42.580095,"lng":1.479198,"ele":1581.4},{"lat":42.580089,"lng":1.479269,"ele":1583.5},{"lat":42.580083,"lng":1.479331,"ele":1585},{"lat":42.580089,"lng":1.479396,"ele":1586.1},{"lat":42.580102,"lng":1.479456,"ele":1587.1},{"lat":42.580124,"