-El índice IBP es un sistema de valoración automático que puntúa el grado de dificulta de la ruta que realizamos.', '{"en":"This challenging one-way route ascends Pic Tort (2886m) starting from the upper station of the Estany Gento cable car. The initial path to Estanys de Vidal d''Amunt is well-marked, but beyond this point, the trail disappears, requiring hikers to find their own way to the summit, guided by occasional cairns.\n\nThe descent involves traversing the Estanys d''en Vidal d''Amunt again, then descending two grassy channels to connect with the GR 11.20 at Estany del Mar, leading to Refugi de Colomina. This route is suitable for experienced hikers comfortable with route-finding in unmarked terrain.","ca":"Aquesta ruta exigent d''anada ascendeix al Pic Tort (2886m) començant des de l''estació superior del telefèric d''Estany Gento. El camí inicial fins als Estanys de Vidal d''Amunt està ben marcat, però a partir d''aquest punt, el sender desapareix, requerint que els excursionistes trobin el seu propi camí cap al cim, guiats per fites ocasionals.\n\nEl descens implica travessar de nou els Estanys d''en Vidal d''Amunt, per després baixar per dues canals herbades fins a connectar amb el GR 11.20 a l''Estany del Mar, que porta al Refugi de Colomina. Aquesta ruta és adequada per a excursionistes experimentats que se sentin còmodes amb l''orientació en terreny sense marcar.","es":"Esta exigente ruta de ida asciende al Pic Tort (2886m) comenzando desde la estación superior del teleférico de Estany Gento. El camino inicial hasta los Estanys de Vidal d''Amunt está bien marcado, pero a partir de este punto, el sendero desaparece, requiriendo que los excursionistas encuentren su propio camino hacia la cumbre, guiados por hitos ocasionales.\n\nEl descenso implica atravesar de nuevo los Estanys d''en Vidal d''Amunt, para luego bajar por dos canales herbadas hasta conectar con el GR 11.20 en el Estany del Mar, que lleva al Refugi de Colomina. Esta ruta es adecuada para excursionistas experimentados que se sientan cómodos con la orientación en terreno sin marcar."}'::jsonb, 'nandomoneda', 7580, 785, 527, 2889, 2141, 'difficult', 'one-way', NULL, 22440, 1593, '2025-09-21', '2025-08', '[{"lat":42.51046,"lng":0.996124,"ele":2159.7},{"lat":42.510461,"lng":0.996123,"ele":2159.7},{"lat":42.510463,"lng":0.996106,"ele":2159.7},{"lat":42.510513,"lng":0.996121,"ele":2159.7},{"lat":42.510557,"lng":0.99607,"ele":2159.2},{"lat":42.510602,"lng":0.995995,"ele":2157.3},{"lat":42.510614,"lng":0.995975,"ele":2154.4},{"lat":42.510636,"lng":0.995942,"ele":2153.9},{"lat":42.510654,"lng":0.995913,"ele":2154.4},{"lat":42.510663,"lng":0.995896,"ele":2153.4},{"lat":42.510722,"lng":0.995829,"ele":2153.9},{"lat":42.510776,"lng":0.995769,"ele":2153.9},{"lat":42.510836,"lng":0.995707,"ele":2153.9},{"lat":42.510879,"lng":0.995632,"ele":2155.4},{"lat":42.510909,"lng":0.995564,"ele":2154.4},{"lat":42.510951,"lng":0.995477,"ele":2153.9},{"lat":42.511004,"lng":0.995353,"ele":2153.4},{"lat":42.511046,"lng":0.995278,"ele":2152},{"lat":42.5111,"lng":0.99519,"ele":2151.5},{"lat":42.51113,"lng":0.995097,"ele":2150.1},{"lat":42.511166,"lng":0.995026,"ele":2149.6},{"lat":42.51124,"lng":0.994968,"ele":2148.6},{"lat":42.51131,"lng":0.994922,"ele":2146.7},{"lat":42.51138,"lng":0.994862,"ele":2145.3},{"lat":42.511423,"lng":0.994802,"ele":2142.9},{"lat":42.511459,"lng":0.994767,"ele":2142.9},{"lat":42.51149,"lng":0.99474,"ele":2142.4},{"lat":42.511515,"lng":0.994723,"ele":2142.9},{"lat":42.511552,"lng":0.994683,"ele":2142.4},{"lat":42.51163,"lng":0.994623,"ele":2141.4},{"lat":42.511658,"lng":0.994603,"ele":2140.9},{"lat":42.511702,"lng":0.99461,"ele":2141.4},{"lat":42.5117,"lng":0.99461,"ele":2140.9},{"lat":42.511736,"lng":0.994601,"ele":2140.9},{"lat":42.5118,"lng":0.994588,"ele":2140.9},{"lat":42.511861,"lng":0.994585,"ele":2140.9},{"lat":42.511894,"lng":0.994588,"ele":2141.9},{"lat":42.511971,"lng":0.994557,"ele":2143.4},{"lat":42.512052,"lng":0.994541,"ele":2144.3},{"la