15:30 h (11,320 km - 804 msnm) Pç. Nova de Sant Boi de Lluçanès (Final Ruta)', '{"en":"This easy 11.3 km loop starts from Sant Boi de Lluçanès, with 268 m of elevation gain. The route is designed to be accessible, with a gradual ascent if done counter-clockwise, distributing the positive elevation over 7.5 km.\n\nThe trail leads to the Mare de Déu dels Munts sanctuary and the summit of Els Munts, passing by the Ermita de Sant Roc. The descent back to Sant Boi follows a well-marked track, with sections of significant negative elevation.\n\nPart of the return journey follows the GR® 3 Sender Històric, passing by the Roure de la Senyora. This route is suitable for a pleasant day hike, offering a mix of cultural and natural sights.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular fàcil d''11.3 km comença des de Sant Boi de Lluçanès, amb 268 m de desnivell positiu. La ruta està dissenyada per ser accessible, amb un ascens gradual si es fa en sentit antihorari, distribuint el desnivell positiu al llarg de 7.5 km.\n\nEl sender porta al santuari de la Mare de Déu dels Munts i al cim dels Munts, passant per l''Ermita de Sant Roc. El descens de tornada a Sant Boi segueix una pista ben senyalitzada, amb trams de desnivell negatiu significatiu.\n\nPart del trajecte de tornada segueix el GR® 3 Sender Històric, passant pel Roure de la Senyora. Aquesta ruta és adequada per a una agradable excursió d''un dia, oferint una barreja de llocs d''interès cultural i natural.","es":"Esta ruta circular fácil de 11.3 km comienza desde Sant Boi de Lluçanès, con 268 m de desnivel positivo. La ruta está diseñada para ser accesible, con un ascenso gradual si se hace en sentido antihorario, distribuyendo el desnivel positivo a lo largo de 7.5 km.\n\nEl sendero lleva al santuario de la Mare de Déu dels Munts y a la cumbre de Els Munts, pasando por la Ermita de Sant Roc. El descenso de vuelta a Sant Boi sigue una pista bien señalizada, con tramos de desnivel negativo significativo.\n\nParte del trayecto de vuelta sigue el GR® 3 Sender Històric, pasando por el Roure de la Senyora. Esta ruta es adecuada para una agradable excursión de un día, ofreciendo una mezcla de lugares de interés cultural y natural."}'::jsonb, 'ajuradopoza', 11330, 268, 268, 1057, 799, 'easy', 'loop', 13800, 20760, 2017, '2025-09-29', '2025-08', '[{"lat":42.058576,"lng":2.150835,"ele":804},{"lat":42.058681,"lng":2.150957,"ele":804},{"lat":42.058626,"lng":2.15085,"ele":804},{"lat":42.058896,"lng":2.151695,"ele":806.9},{"lat":42.058965,"lng":2.15165,"ele":807},{"lat":42.059006,"lng":2.151573,"ele":806.8},{"lat":42.058969,"lng":2.151609,"ele":806.9},{"lat":42.058915,"lng":2.151589,"ele":806.7},{"lat":42.058867,"lng":2.151551,"ele":806.5},{"lat":42.058911,"lng":2.151583,"ele":806.7},{"lat":42.058861,"lng":2.151542,"ele":806.5},{"lat":42.058823,"lng":2.151504,"ele":806.2},{"lat":42.058786,"lng":2.151461,"ele":805.9},{"lat":42.05874,"lng":2.15148,"ele":805.8},{"lat":42.05876,"lng":2.151423,"ele":805.7},{"lat":42.058731,"lng":2.151482,"ele":805.8},{"lat":42.058711,"lng":2.151547,"ele":805.9},{"lat":42.058744,"lng":2.151503,"ele":805.9},{"lat":42.058764,"lng":2.151445,"ele":805.8},{"lat":42.058797,"lng":2.151387,"ele":805.7},{"lat":42.058829,"lng":2.151332,"ele":805.4},{"lat":42.058874,"lng":2.151322,"ele":805.5},{"lat":42.05884,"lng":2.151364,"ele":805.7},{"lat":42.058802,"lng":2.151404,"ele":805.7},{"lat":42.058766,"lng":2.151453,"ele":805.8},{"lat":42.058721,"lng":2.151489,"ele":805.8},{"lat":42.058697,"lng":2.151541,"ele":805.9},{"lat":42.058668,"lng":2.151589,"ele":805.9},{"lat":42.058632,"lng":2.151628,"ele":805.9},{"lat":42.058586,"lng":2.151659,"ele":805.9},{"lat":42.058534,"lng":2.151677,"ele":805.7},{"lat":42.058499,"lng":2.151715,"ele":805.6},{"lat":42.058455,"lng":2.151752,"ele":805.4},{"lat":42.058403,"lng":2.151748,"ele":805.3},{"lat":42.058355,"lng":2.151772,"ele":805.1},{"lat":42.05831,"lng":2.151784,"ele":805},{"lat":42.058274,"lng":2.151827,"ele":805.1},{"lat":42.058232,"lng":2.151855,"ele":805.1},